        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-10-23T16:27:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am tempted to not make this a new config option and enabled FIFO i2c transation for NPCX7 on ToT.\n\nWhat risks do you see with enabling i2c FIFO on all new NPCX7 platforms?",
